--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

canopy vendors two tmux plugins as ordinary files in plugins/, copied from
upstream at the commits recorded in plugins/VERSIONS. Both are the work of
Bruno Sutic and are distributed under the MIT License. Their license texts
are kept alongside the code they cover and are reproduced in full there:

  plugins/tmux-resurrect/   Copyright (C) 2014 Bruno Sutic
                            https://github.com/tmux-plugins/tmux-resurrect
                            MIT, see plugins/tmux-resurrect/LICENSE.md

  plugins/tmux-continuum/   Copyright (C) Bruno Sutic
                            https://github.com/tmux-plugins/tmux-continuum
                            MIT, see plugins/tmux-continuum/LICENSE.md

canopy modifies neither. plugins/vendor.sh copies each tree verbatim at its
pinned commit and records a checksum in plugins/CHECKSUMS; what canopy adds
lives outside those directories, in plugins/strategies/. See
plugins/README.md for why they are vendored rather than fetched.
